%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  participant Coord as Coordinator
  participant A as Node a
  participant B as Node b
  participant S3 as SeaweedFS S3
  Note over Coord,A: 1. FenceEpoch -> (b, e2)
  Note over A,B: a writable (local step 4)
  Coord->>A: 2. SealSource
  Note over A,B: 0 writable (steps 2-5)
  Coord->>A: 3. ShipFinal
  A->>S3: put seg 4-5, close .db = H
  Coord->>B: 4. Rebuild (.staged)
  S3-->>B: restore slot 5
  Note over Coord,B: 5. Verify P == 5, sha256 == H
  Coord->>B: 6. Activate e2
  B->>S3: put 6 (e2=H)
  Note over B,S3: install .db/.owner
  Coord->>A: 7. RetireSource
